    "detailed_description": "Game Background<br />\r\nOur protagonist has lived in seclusion in the deep mountains since childhood<br />\r\nLiving an independent life<br />\r\nThe life in the bamboo forest on the mountain is very quiet<br />\r\nAnd then there's a crisis, go and see if it's close<br />\r\n-----<br />\r\nGame gameplay<br />\r\n----<br />\r\nConstruction system:<br />\r\nHow can one survive deep in the mountains?<br />\r\nYou must take care of yourself.<br />\r\nFor example, you must collect various materials to build your own cabin<br />\r\nCombat System:<br />\r\nThe unknown undead constantly appears in the deep forest<br />\r\nYou must protect yourself well<br />\r\nFight against the undead, eliminate all monsters, and obtain their spoils to continuously improve one's abilities<br />\r\nAt the same time, you also need to pay attention to discovering the secret of the appearance of the undead",
